{"id":93,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ضُّحَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"وَلَلْأَخِرَةُ خَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٌ ل</span>َّكَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُولَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"أَلَمْ يَجِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>كَ يَتِي<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مًا ف</span>َـَٔـاوَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآل<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">اًّ ف</span>َهَدَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"وَوَجَدَكَ ع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِل<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">اً ف</span>َأَغْنَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"فَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>هَرْ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"}]}